{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415760","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415760","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041576001:1":{"text":"헥토르시여! 내가 잘못 본 게 아니었어. 겨울 여신님!","source_cn":"赫托啊！我没看错，真的是冬喉女士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1149BFFC2A396885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576002:1":{"text":"그냥 아르나라고 불러라.","source_cn":"叫我阿尔娜就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8057B3B962F34BD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576003:0":{"text":"네?! 아니요, 아니요! 그건 너무 무례하죠. 저희 드워프 모두 여신님의 전설을 듣고 자랐는데요!","source_cn":"不不不，这样显得太不尊重您了！我们矮人都听过您的传说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC7DDBD45D1F8FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576004:0":{"text":"홀로 마물의 봉쇄를 뚫고 스틸 포지를 구해내신 위대한 반신 전사...","source_cn":"一位伟大的半神战士，孤身一人突破了魔物的封锁，拯救了炉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x423BD36611C7AB43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576005:0":{"text":"나는 혼자가 아니었다. 내 곁에 그니즈라는 용감한 드워프 친구가 있었지.","source_cn":"我并不是一个人，还有位勇敢的矮人朋友，他叫格尼兹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74B162967E7245D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576006:0":{"text":"잘 알고 있어요. 그니즈 사부님! 바로 지금의 무기 제작 기술 규범을 만든 분이시죠!","source_cn":"对！格尼兹大师！就是他制定了现在通用的武器锻造工艺规范！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19CC8499A1F74D87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576007:0":{"text":"여신님과 어깨를 나란히 하고 싸웠던 그 기억 덕분에, 진정한 무기에 무엇이 깃들어야 하는지 비로소 깨닫게 되었다고 하셨죠.","source_cn":"他说过，正因曾经有幸与您并肩作战，他才会明白一把合格武...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F6AC0305F5CD17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576008:0":{"text":"과찬이야. 그니즈의 포기하지 않는 정신이야말로 승리의 핵심이었지.","source_cn":"他不屈的精神才是致胜的关键。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA544F8049353F0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576009:0":{"text":"그 정신도 여신님에게 배웠다는 말도 하셨어요!","source_cn":"他也说过！这正是从您身上学到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD82B8D99FD8A5F54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576010:1":{"text":"하하하! 누가 들으면 다 내 덕인 줄 알겠구나. 그저 서로를 굳게 믿었기에 가능했던 승리였지.","source_cn":"谬赞了，孩子。是我们相互支撑，才打赢了那场战役。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44016C63D8EB9CA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576011:1":{"text":"그나저나 그니즈의 손자는 잘 지내고 있나? 스틸 포지의 열기를 못 느낀 지도 벌써 까마득하구나.","source_cn":"说到格尼兹，他的孙子还好吗？我很久没有回炉卫城了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6903D09425A5C50A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576012:1":{"text":"볼프 사부님 말씀이시라면, 제가 한동안 그분 밑에서 견습생으로 일한 적이 있어요.","source_cn":"您是说沃尔夫大师吗？我在他的手下当过一段时间学徒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA619F048FDBF397A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576013:1":{"text":"그래. 볼프. 그니즈처럼 풍성한 붉은 수염을 가지고 있는 아이였지.","source_cn":"嗯。他和格尼兹一样，都有着浓密的红色胡须。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AA18D21B81D08DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576014:1":{"text":"음, 사실... 제가 볼프 사부님을 뵈었을 때는 이미 수염이 하얗게 세었던 뒤여서요...","source_cn":"呃，其实呢，我认识沃尔夫大师时，他已经是个白胡子老爷爷了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x213E2681BBB37E29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576015:1":{"text":"하... 그 강인한 드워프도 세월 앞에선 어쩔 수 없나 보군...","source_cn":"……呵，时间啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2C7B466758C2832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576016:1":{"text":"겨울 여신님, 제가 뭐 잘못 말한 건 아니죠?","source_cn":"冬喉女士？我，我应该没有说错什么吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC69DCB38B5722AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576017:1":{"text":"지금도 아주 큰 잘못을 하고 있지.","source_cn":"有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B9FC159EAE9696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041576018:1":{"text":"네에?!","source_cn":"啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0A673969906DD22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041576019:1":{"text":"그냥 아르나라고 불러라.","source_cn":"叫我阿尔娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63A86532148E44B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041576020:1":{"text":"...네, 아르나 님! 도움이 필요하시다면 말씀만 하세요. 저와 깊은바위 마을이 언제든 힘이 되어 드릴게요!","source_cn":"……好吧，阿尔娜女士！如果您有需要，我和深岩村都很乐意...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BD85FC64FE5863D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔娜":{"text":"아르나","source":"阿尔娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":2}}